# FWG-UltraEdge 🌍⚡ — Observability Guide

## Sentry Integration
1. Get DSN from https://sentry.io
2. Run: wrangler secret put SENTRY_DSN --env production
3. Errors auto-captured via src/middleware/sentry.ts

## Logpush (Cloudflare Dashboard)
1. Dash → Workers & Pages → FWG-Network → Logpush
2. Create pipeline → destination: R2 or HTTP endpoint
3. Fields: timestamp, outcome, logs, exceptions

## Health Check Monitoring
- Staging:    https://fwg-network-staging.fasterwgseverkh.workers.dev/health
- Production: https://fwg-network.fasterwgseverkh.workers.dev/health

## Slack Alerts
Configured via SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL secret
Triggers: deploy fail, health check fail, auto-rollback
